+		 *if 10bit enable: 64*1.5 = 96M(YUV422)
+		 *if support 4K2K-YUV444-10bit-WR:3840*2160*4*6 ~= 200M
+		 *if support 4K2K-YUV422-10bit-wr:3840*2160*3*6 ~= 160M
